{
    "title": "STAR: Super Tricky Amazing Run",
    "description": "\"STAR\" is an exciting casual game where you become a participant in thrilling competitions! In this game with obstacles, you need to control stumble guys or fall guys and overcome numerous obstacles. Here, the fall guys are ready to participate in various competitions, like in an epic race!\r\n\r\nIn \"STAR,\" a casual game with running stumble guys, you will participate in exciting competitions. Your task is not just to play as running fall guys but also to overcome obstacles. Popular games featuring bumble guys always attract attention.\r\n\r\n\"STAR\" is not only a game with run guys but also a star run. Every player can customize their stumble guys to dive even deeper into the competitions. Obstacle course games in \"\"STAR\"\" are always epic races!\r\n\r\nThe casual game \"STAR\" awaits all who dream of playing as stumble guys and offers various epic races. Embark on competitions across different tracks and develop your guys to become true champions! Fall run is always fun guys.\r\n\r\nIn the game \"STAR,\" everyone can feel like a champion by playing in obstacle course games and enjoying a casual game! Don\u2019t miss the chance to be part of the thrilling world of fall run! We are similar to stumble guys and fall guys. Play with us! In \"STAR,\" you can participate in star runs and enjoy exciting games where you need to run and jump. Our stumble guys are always ready for challenges. Play \"STAR\" and experience the fun guys!\r\n\r\n\"STAR\" is an obstacle course game where bumble guys overcome obstacles. Become part of the exciting world of fun guys and enjoy popular games. Your fall guys are ready for epic race games.\r\n\r\nOur bumble guys are always ready for new challenges. \r\nJoin the players enjoying the casual game \"STAR\"! Bumble guys are ready to start obstacle race and epic race. Feel the spirit of competition and become the top player among all.\r\n\r\nIn the casual game \"STAR,\" you\u2019ll find incredible adventures with fall guys and unique challenges! Each level is a new challenge to overcome, like in fall run. Run, jump, and enjoy cool obstacle race games. Test your skills, and your fall guys will become true champions in this thrilling game similar to stumble guys! Games like this are perfect for everyone who loves obstacles and fun guys!",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;STAR&quot; is an exciting casual game where you become a participant in thrilling competitions! In this game with obstacles, you need to control stumble guys or fall guys and overcome numerous obstacles. Here, the fall guys are ready to participate in various competitions, like in an epic race!<br><br>In &quot;STAR,&quot; a casual game with running stumble guys, you will participate in exciting competitions. Your task is not just to play as running fall guys but also to overcome obstacles. Popular games featuring bumble guys always attract attention.<br><br>&quot;STAR&quot; is not only a game with run guys but also a star run. Every player can customize their stumble guys to dive even deeper into the competitions. Obstacle course games in &quot;&quot;STAR&quot;&quot; are always epic races!<br><br>The casual game &quot;STAR&quot; awaits all who dream of playing as stumble guys and offers various epic races. Embark on competitions across different tracks and develop your guys to become true champions! Fall run is always fun guys.<br><br>In the game &quot;STAR,&quot; everyone can feel like a champion by playing in obstacle course games and enjoying a casual game! Don\u2019t miss the chance to be part of the thrilling world of fall run! We are similar to stumble guys and fall guys. Play with us! In &quot;STAR,&quot; you can participate in star runs and enjoy exciting games where you need to run and jump. Our stumble guys are always ready for challenges. Play &quot;STAR&quot; and experience the fun guys!<br><br>&quot;STAR&quot; is an obstacle course game where bumble guys overcome obstacles. Become part of the exciting world of fun guys and enjoy popular games. Your fall guys are ready for epic race games.<br><br>Our bumble guys are always ready for new challenges. <br>Join the players enjoying the casual game &quot;STAR&quot;! Bumble guys are ready to start obstacle race and epic race. Feel the spirit of competition and become the top player among all.<br><br>In the casual game &quot;STAR,&quot; you\u2019ll find incredible adventures with fall guys and unique challenges! Each level is a new challenge to overcome, like in fall run. Run, jump, and enjoy cool obstacle race games. Test your skills, and your fall guys will become true champions in this thrilling game similar to stumble guys! Games like this are perfect for everyone who loves obstacles and fun guys!",
